---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Beranda - KITA-KTP Pelayanan Inklusif">
  <div class="w-full max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20 space-y-10" x-data="homePage()">

    <!-- 1. Hero Section Lengkap & Edukatif -->
    <header class="text-center space-y-5 pt-2 sm:pt-4">
      <!-- Badge Ramah Difabel & Lansia -->
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-black border transition-all"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 shadow-xs'"
      >
        <span aria-hidden="true">🇮🇩</span>
        <span>Layanan Administrasi Kependudukan Terpadu & Ramah Difabel</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Judul Utama -->
      <h1
        id="hero-heading"
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'"
      >
        Identitas Kependudukan yang Setara untuk Semua Warga
      </h1>

      <!-- Deskripsi Edukatif Hak Identitas -->
      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-justify sm:text-center"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/90' : 'text-slate-700'"
      >
        Setiap warga negara memiliki hak konstitusional untuk memiliki KTP-el secara mudah, cepat, dan bermartabat. Melalui portal <strong>KITA-KTP</strong>, Dinas Kependudukan dan Pencatatan Sipil berkomitmen menghadirkan <strong>layanan jemput bola perekaman biometrik ke rumah</strong> bagi warga lanjut usia dan penyandang disabilitas, serta sistem antrean mandiri transparan bagi masyarakat umum tanpa diskriminasi.
      </p>

      <!-- Foto Hero Representatif Lansia & Keluarga Berkualitas Tinggi -->
      <figure
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border shadow-md relative mt-4 transition-all"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black' : 'border-slate-300 bg-slate-100'"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576765608535-5f04d1e3f289?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
          alt="Potret keluarga lansia tersenyum bahagia saat mendapatkan pelayanan administrasi kependudukan yang ramah dan nyaman di rumah"
          class="w-full h-60 sm:h-72 object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
          loading="eager"
        />
        <figcaption
          class="p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-center border-t leading-snug"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700'"
        >
          🤝 <strong>Pelayanan Humanis & Setara:</strong> Petugas hadir langsung mendampingi warga hingga KTP fisik diterima tanpa beban birokrasi.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <!-- Tombol Audio TTS Pembaca Seluruh Halaman -->
      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          @click="toggleAudioGuide()"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl font-black text-sm border-2 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 cursor-pointer shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 active:scale-95"
          :class="isSpeaking
            ? (colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-[#FACC15] text-black border-[#FACC15] ring-4 ring-yellow-400' : 'bg-amber-500 text-white border-amber-600 ring-4 ring-amber-300 animate-pulse')
            : (colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-black text-[#FACC15] border-[#FACC15] hover:bg-neutral-900' : 'bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:ring-slate-400')"
          aria-live="polite"
        >
          <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true" x-text="isSpeaking ? '⏹️' : '🔊'"></span>
          <span x-text="isSpeaking ? 'Hentikan Panduan Suara' : 'Dengarkan Panduan Audio Halaman Ini'"></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 2. Tiga Pintu Layanan Utama (Visual Card Besar + Foto Landscape + Penjelasan Detail) -->
    <main aria-label="Pilihan Pintu Layanan Utama KITA-KTP" class="space-y-6">

      <div class="text-center space-y-1">
        <h2
          class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'"
        >
          Pilih Pintu Layanan Anda
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
          Tekan salah satu kartu di bawah ini untuk membuka formulir permohonan khusus:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pintu 1: Layanan Lansia (Aksen Amber/Kuning) -->
      <article
        class="rounded-3xl border-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus-within:ring-4"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] focus-within:ring-white' : 'border-amber-300 bg-linear-to-b from-amber-50/70 to-orange-50/50 hover:border-amber-400 hover:shadow-xl focus-within:ring-amber-400'"
      >
        <!-- Foto Kartu Lansia -->
        <div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden bg-amber-100">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581579438747-1dc8d17bbce4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Foto kakek dan nenek tersenyum ramah dan bahagia di teras rumah"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-amber-300 bg-amber-100 text-amber-950'"
            >
              🧓 Prioritas 60+ Tahun
            </span>
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-amber-300 bg-amber-100 text-amber-950'"
            >
              🚐 Jemput Bola
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Konten Penjelasan Layanan Lansia -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3
              class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'"
            >
              Layanan Warga Lansia
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-sm font-extrabold"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-amber-900'"
            >
              Petugas Rekam Biometrik KTP Datang ke Rumah (Door-to-Door)
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-y py-3"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]/90' : 'border-amber-200 text-slate-700'"
          >
            <p>
              🌟 <strong>Program Jemput Bola Khusus:</strong> Bagi oma, opa, atau warga lansia yang mengalami kesulitan fisik maupun kondisi tirah baring (<em>bedridden</em>), tim mobile Dukcapil akan datang langsung ke alamat rumah membawa perangkat kamera dan pemindai sidik jari.
            </p>
            <p>
              ⚡ <strong>Bebas Antre & Pendampingan Penuh:</strong> Tanpa antre berdiri lama di loket kantor. Petugas mendampingi seluruh proses pengisian data dan verifikasi dokumen secara ramah.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/lansia"
            @click="playClick()"
            class="w-full py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-base border-2 transition-all flex items-center justify-between px-6 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 active:scale-98 shadow-sm"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-[#FACC15] text-black border-[#FACC15] hover:bg-yellow-400' : 'bg-amber-500 text-white border-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-300'"
          >
            <span>Buka Formulir Pintu Lansia</span>
            <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pintu 2: Layanan Disabilitas (Aksen Indigo/Ungu) -->
      <article
        class="rounded-3xl border-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus-within:ring-4"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] focus-within:ring-white' : 'border-purple-300 bg-linear-to-b from-purple-50/70 to-indigo-50/50 hover:border-purple-400 hover:shadow-xl focus-within:ring-purple-400'"
      >
        <!-- Foto Kartu Disabilitas -->
        <div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden bg-purple-100">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Interaksi pendampingan ramah difabel dan aksesibilitas inklusif"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-purple-300 bg-purple-100 text-purple-950'"
            >
              ♿ Akses Penuh Difabel
            </span>
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-purple-300 bg-purple-100 text-purple-950'"
            >
              🤟 Juru Bahasa Isyarat
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Konten Penjelasan Layanan Disabilitas -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3
              class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'"
            >
              Layanan Penyandang Disabilitas
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-sm font-extrabold"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-purple-900'"
            >
              Akses Ramah Sensorik, Fisik, Netra, Rungu & Jemput Bola
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-y py-3"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]/90' : 'border-purple-200 text-slate-700'"
          >
            <p>
              🎧 <strong>Audio-First Self-Voicing:</strong> Formulir digital pada portal ini secara otomatis menyuarakan instruksi tiap kolom dan pilihan tombol, memudahkan penyandang disabilitas sensorik netra (*low vision* dan tuna netra).
            </p>
            <p>
              🚐 <strong>Fasilitas Khusus & Kunjungan Panti:</strong> Layanan jemput bola biometrik fleksibel ke kediaman pribadi maupun panti sosial rehabilitasi, didukung juru bahasa isyarat dan loket tanpa tangga bagi pengguna kursi roda.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/disabilitas"
            @click="playClick()"
            class="w-full py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-base border-2 transition-all flex items-center justify-between px-6 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 active:scale-98 shadow-sm"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-[#FACC15] text-black border-[#FACC15] hover:bg-yellow-400' : 'bg-purple-600 text-white border-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-700 focus:ring-purple-300'"
          >
            <span>Buka Formulir Pintu Disabilitas</span>
            <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pintu 3: Layanan Masyarakat Umum (Aksen Biru) -->
      <article
        class="rounded-3xl border-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 focus-within:ring-4"
        :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] focus-within:ring-white' : 'border-blue-300 bg-linear-to-b from-blue-50/70 to-sky-50/50 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-xl focus-within:ring-blue-400'"
      >
        <!-- Foto Kartu Umum -->
        <div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden bg-blue-100">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
            alt="Loket pelayanan administrasi kependudukan modern, rapi, dan cepat"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-blue-300 bg-blue-100 text-blue-950'"
            >
              🏢 Warga Umum
            </span>
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-blue-300 bg-blue-100 text-blue-950'"
            >
              🎟️ Antrean Digital
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Konten Penjelasan Layanan Umum -->
        <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3
              class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-slate-900'"
            >
              Layanan Masyarakat Umum
            </h3>
            <p
              class="text-sm font-extrabold"
              :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]' : 'text-blue-900'"
            >
              Antrean Digital Mandiri & Penjadwalan Loket Kecamatan
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-y py-3"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15]/40 text-[#FACC15]/90' : 'border-blue-200 text-slate-700'"
          >
            <p>
              ⏱️ <strong>Pemesanan Tiket Mandiri:</strong> Pilih sendiri tanggal kunjungan dan jam perekaman biometrik di kantor kecamatan terdekat tanpa perlu mengantre berjam-jam sejak subuh.
            </p>
            <p>
              🪪 <strong>KTP Pemula, Rusak, & Hilang:</strong> Cocok bagi warga usia 17 tahun yang baru pertama kali merekam KTP-el, maupun permohonan cetak ulang KTP fisik akibat rusak atau hilang.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/umum"
            @click="playClick()"
            class="w-full py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-base border-2 transition-all flex items-center justify-between px-6 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 active:scale-98 shadow-sm"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'bg-[#FACC15] text-black border-[#FACC15] hover:bg-yellow-400' : 'bg-blue-600 text-white border-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-700 focus:ring-blue-300'"
          >
            <span>Buka Formulir Pintu Umum</span>
            <span class="text-xl" aria-hidden="true">➔</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </main>

    <!-- 3. Bagian Edukasi: Alur 4 Langkah Mudah Layanan KITA-KTP -->
    <section
      aria-labelledby="flow-heading"
      class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 space-y-6"
      :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-md'"
    >
      <div class="text-center space-y-1">
        <h2 id="flow-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">
          Alur 4 Langkah Mudah Layanan KITA-KTP
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
          Proses cepat, transparan, dan tidak memerlukan syarat berkas fotokopi berbelit-belit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 list-none p-0 m-0">

        <!-- Langkah 1 -->
        <li
          class="p-4 rounded-2xl border flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-neutral-950 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800'"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0 border"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-blue-300 bg-blue-100 text-blue-900'"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            1
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-black text-sm">Pilih Kategori Layanan</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
              Pilih pintu yang sesuai dengan kondisi pemohon: Lansia (60+), Penyandang Disabilitas, atau Antrean Umum.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <!-- Langkah 2 -->
        <li
          class="p-4 rounded-2xl border flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-neutral-950 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800'"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0 border"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-amber-300 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900'"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            2
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-black text-sm">Lengkapi Data Ringkas</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
              Cukup masukkan 16 digit NIK dan alamat domisili. Sistem langsung memproses permohonan tanpa berkas fotokopi rumit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <!-- Langkah 3 -->
        <li
          class="p-4 rounded-2xl border flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-neutral-950 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800'"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0 border"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-purple-300 bg-purple-100 text-purple-900'"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            3
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-black text-sm">Verifikasi & Penjadwalan</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
              Petugas memverifikasi berkas lalu menjadwalkan kunjungan jemput bola ke rumah atau menerbitkan tiket antrean kecamatan.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <!-- Langkah 4 -->
        <li
          class="p-4 rounded-2xl border flex items-start gap-3.5 transition-all"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-neutral-950 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 text-slate-800'"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0 border"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-[#FACC15] text-black' : 'border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900'"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            4
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-black text-sm">KTP Siap Diterima</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed" :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'text-[#FACC15]/80' : 'text-slate-600'">
              KTP fisik selesai dicetak. Untuk lansia dan difabel diantar gratis langsung ke pintu rumah oleh kurir dinas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Banner Cepat Pelacakan Status Dokumen -->
    <section
      aria-labelledby="tracking-banner-heading"
      class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 space-y-5 transition-all"
      :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-xl'"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black border"
          :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-neutral-900 text-[#FACC15]' : 'border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-amber-300'"
        >
          <span aria-hidden="true">🔍</span>
          <span>Pelacakan Real-time</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="tracking-banner-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">
          Sudah Pernah Mendaftar? Lacak Status KTP Anda
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-90">
          Masukkan Nomor Registrasi (contoh: <code>KITA-2026-8812</code>) atau 16 digit NIK Anda untuk memantau status pencetakan dokumen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Form Pencarian Cepat -->
      <form @submit.prevent="handleQuickSearch()" class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
          <input
            type="text"
            x-model="quickNik"
            placeholder="Masukkan NIK atau No. Registrasi..."
            class="flex-1 px-4 py-3.5 rounded-2xl border-2 font-bold text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 transition-all"
            :class="colorFilter === 'high-contrast' ? 'border-[#FACC15] bg-black text-[#FACC15] placeholder-[#FACC15]/60 focus:ring-white' : 'border-slate-700 bg-slate-800 text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:ring-blue-400'"
            aria-label="Nomor Registrasi atau NIK untuk pelacakan"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            @click="playClick()"
